# KAPLAY Tags Reference

## Why tags

Tags provide lightweight grouping and query semantics for runtime objects.

## Common usage

- Add tags in object component arrays: `"player"`, `"npc"`, `"interactable"`.
- Use tag-based handlers for broad behavior:
  - collision by class
  - batch updates
  - debug filtering

## Best practices

- Keep tags semantic and role-based.
- Avoid overloading one tag for unrelated systems.
- Prefer explicit object references for owner-specific behavior.
